      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for saying that. but it feels deeper than just \"confidence.\" it's like... even when i'm not trying to be the center of attention, people just align themselves with whatever direction i'm pointing. it's almost like they're waiting for me to say something. i've started feeling like these aren't just random coincidences. honestly, it feels like i'm being prepared for something. like there's a specific path or a certain role i'm supposed to be stepping into. do u see any patterns in what i'm describing? like, could this be more than just being a good speaker?",
